{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-86","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","rows":[{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-86-talk-403815851-line","text":"你又一次来到了夫莱昂机械联盟的停泊港湾，一位机械招待员带你走上台阶…你发现这台阶是由一条条机械手臂托举而成的，你在上面走得摇摇晃晃。你一直向前，直到看见「星际和平机械分部商城」的招牌。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-86-talk-403815852-line","text":"你对这景象很熟悉…你来到了柜台前。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-86-talk-403815853-line","text":"「机械城分部，如果手里有好东西，就拿来升级吧。」机械职员懒得说太多，示意你自己选。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-86-talk-403815854-line","text":"你很想对它的脑袋来上狠狠一拳…但你忍住了这种欲望。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-86-text-3814342574503320514-choice","text":"升级你的认知。","speaker":""},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-86-text-7943284079180294518-effect","text":"升级香涎干酪，测不准匣和异木果实。","speaker":""},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-86-text-13336929472671452605-choice","text":"升级香涎干酪。","speaker":""},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-86-text-8877023046333997086-choice","text":"升级测不准匣。","speaker":""},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-86-text-8723949142131594746-choice","text":"升级异木果实。","speaker":""}]}
